riptermIRC — RIP Viewer for Mystic BBS
Based on RIPtermJS by Carl Gorringe (GPLv3)
Forked by Kiddo — Mystic BBS IRC Fork

Standalone browser-based RIP viewer.
Open viewer.html, drag and drop .rip files.

Handles CP437 bytes 128-255 correctly.
Works with chg2rip v2.3 output.
No PabloDraw needed.

Ecstasy BBS — FTN 1:152/158
